# Project context (Forge)

Multi-service web app: submit CFD cases, run in Docker, visualize VTK, optional Vertex AI assistant.

## Layout (this repo)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `frontend/` | Next.js UI (jobs, viewer controls, AI chat client) |
| `backend/` | Python microservices (shared image, different CMD in Compose) |
| `backend/services/bff/` | Backend-for-Frontend — browser REST/WS on port **8000** |
| `backend/services/simulation/` | Jobs + simulations API, MongoDB, case files on `jobs_data` (internal **8001**) |
| `backend/services/ccs/` | Chat Conversation Service (WebSocket, port **8081**) |
| `backend/services/ics/` | Intent Classification Service (internal, port **8082**) |
| `backend/services/runner/` | Internal runner — launches solver containers via Docker socket (**8080**) |
| `backend/services/trame-viewer/` | Trame + VTK viewer (separate image); reads `case/VTK/` from shared volume (**8090**) |
| `backend/services/pss/` | Predictive Simulation Service — XGBoost on mass runs (**8003**) |
| `deploy/aws/` | Dev-only Terraform + EC2 Compose (not production) |
| `docker-compose.yml` | Local full stack |
| `docs/` | Architecture, development, operations (source of truth for agents) |

Vertex credentials: `backend/credentials/key.json` (not committed).

Shared job files live on Docker volume `jobs_data` at `/jobs/<job_id>/`.

## Key integration points

- UI → BFF: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (port 8000) — REST, AI WebSocket (`/api/ai/ws`), Trame iframe (`/viewer`)
- BFF → simulation: `SIMULATION_SERVICE_URL` (internal HTTP + WebSocket proxy)
- BFF → trame-viewer: `TRAME_VIEWER_URL` (`/viewer` HTTP + `/viewer/ws`)
- Jobs → runner: `POST /internal/run`
- UI → Trame: iframe via BFF `/viewer` + `postMessage` (`frontend/lib/trameBridge.ts`)
- UI → CCS: WebSocket via BFF `/api/ai/ws` (`frontend/lib/aiChat.ts`)
- CCS → ICS: `ICS_URL` for intent classification on each user message
- BFF → PSS: `PSS_SERVICE_URL` — `/api/predictive-models`, `/api/simulations/{id}/predictive-models`
- PSS → simulation: `SIMULATION_SERVICE_URL` for mass-run CSV and simulation config
- Runner → solver: child container must share **`JOBS_VOLUME_NAME`** with simulation service (see `deploy/aws/README.md`)

## Human entrypoints

- Root `README.md` — run locally, ZIP format, troubleshooting
- `deploy/aws/README.md` — AWS dev deploy and secrets
